      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "sub_013_coin_back_01",
      "hash64": "0B50A4A43766A3BE",
      "text": "最近偶～尔会\\n看到掉落的硬币呢。\\r\\n是不是有人拿不了更多硬币了？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
